WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:03.046
Your lifts, on your Home Screen.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.887
Touch and hold your Home Screen. Tap Add Widget, then pick Barforge Weightlifting.

00:00:09.333 --> 00:00:16.067
Choose Next Session, Best Lifts, or Meet Countdown. Meet Countdown is part of Pro.

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:23.406
Best Lifts shows your snatch, clean and jerk, and total. Tap it to open your records.

00:00:23.867 --> 00:00:28.465
Meet Countdown counts the days to your next meet. Tap it to open the Meet Planner.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.940
Download Barforge Weightlifting. No account. Free to start.
